 r←Test_StdForm_009(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;n;appName;formName;rk;posn;size;rk2;globalParms;MyGuiParms
⍝ Check whether Posn and Size got saved in the Registry properly. "regKey2" is set and must be used.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 CreateGlobalParms
 globalParms←⎕NS MyGuiParms
 appName←globalParms.regKey
 formName←'PosnAndSizeTest'
 rk←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiUtils.GetRegPath appName
 rk2←rk,'\Foo'

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions - just in case of any leftovers
 :If ##.WinReg.DoesKeyExist rk
     ##.WinReg.DeleteSubKey rk2
 :EndIf

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←formName
 parms.size←200 400
 parms.posn←35 45
 parms.regKey2←'Foo'
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 posn←100 200
 size←500 220
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Configure',posn,size
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'
 1 ∆Process n.∆Form

 →T.GoToTidyUp posn size≢⍎¨##.WinReg.GetValue¨(rk2,'\posn')(rk2,'\size')
 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ##.WinReg.DeleteSubKey rk2
 ##.WinReg.DeleteSubKey rk
